From 424b5feee1e511d6de8f2e0ec4e1fd747fb3ce7f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: NeoTech <168627+NeoTech@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 26 Nov 2026 16:30:58 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/5] feat(pathkernel): the order stage and the link stage

K4 of the path kernel (#4023), on the K2 part 1 branch.

- Order (crates/pathkernel/src/order/, OrderStage): resolves Auto, reads
  the walk's sense from the region, sets climb or conventional per curve,
  and walks the rings: a ring waits for its neighbours on the side the
  walk comes from; of the ready starts the first one with a proved link
  wins (full-width curves last, then the chain of the air plan, then the
  nearest). OrderedSet now carries the marks of the guide set.
- Link (crates/pathkernel/src/link/, LinkStage): stays at depth on a
  proved path (straight chord, back along the cut just made, or a walk
  along a loop of the centre area), else lifts with the named reason of
  the straight chord. Ported from ring_links and air_chain with their
  reasons. LinkProof::link reads a Level (made, planned, earlier links).
- geometry: geo2d::segments_cross, segment_gap, point_segment_distance.
- Pins: the law suite (L3, link rule, negative pins) and the motion
  kernel_laws readings (0 lifts, 0 crossings on the disc and dog bone).

Refs #4177

